  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This tagine serves 4 and requires 25 minutes of preparation plus 90 minutes of gentle braising. The long cook time is essential for lamb shoulder, which needs slow heat to break down its connective tissue and become truly tender."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: Toast the flaked almonds in a dry frying pan over medium heat for 2-3 minutes until golden before scattering over the finished dish. They add an important textural contrast to the soft lamb and sweet dates."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
